   "evidence_summary_zh": "agent.2 以六个可追溯的全球 AI 创新生态机制案例支撑全栈体系：赫尔辛基 AI Register（公开登记）、新加坡 AI Verify（测试框架）、NIST AI RMF（风险治理）、阿姆斯特丹 Algorithm Register（算法透明）、巴塞罗那 Decidim（参与式议事）、英国 AI Playbook（公共部门采购与治理），分别映射登记、公示、基线评测、算法说明、居民议事和采购门槛；六例 source_id 已逐项登记，生态图谱呈现高校/研究—开发者—企业—专业团队—社区/主管部门—居民的六圈层与交通、产业、空间、公共服务、文化、治理六域回路。纽约、伦敦、新加坡、东京、上海、深圳六项宠物友好对标另计 pet_friendly_case_count=6，不混入 global_case_count。",
   "evidence_summary_en": "Agent.2 is supported by six traceable global AI ecosystem mechanism cases: Helsinki AI Register (public register), Singapore AI Verify (testing framework), NIST AI RMF (risk governance), Amsterdam Algorithm Register (algorithm transparency), Barcelona Decidim (participatory deliberation), and the UK AI Playbook (public-sector procurement and governance). They map respectively to registration, publication, baseline evaluation, algorithm explanation, resident deliberation, and procurement thresholds; each case has its own source_id. The ecosystem atlas shows six layers—universities/research, developers, enterprises, professional teams, communities/competent authorities, and residents—around six domains: transport, industry, space, public services, culture, and governance. New York, London, Singapore, Tokyo, Shanghai, and Shenzhen are a separate pet-friendly benchmark group with pet_friendly_case_count=6 and are excluded from global_case_count."
